# Cloud test environment: the single-machine testbed with Docker mock lab
# PCs, a Wi-Fi emulator and the E2E suite. Not needed to set up or run LabSense, so it
# is kept out of the repository. Its last committed version is 34e8a96; to
# get it back in a checkout (as untracked, ignored files):
#   git restore --source=34e8a96 -- TESTBED.md agent/Dockerfile agent/.dockerignore testbed ':!testbed/loadtest'
TESTBED.md
agent/Dockerfile
agent/.dockerignore
testbed/*
# ...except the scale-test tools, which also run against the real server.
!testbed/loadtest/
